{"seq":76,"slug":"prompt-caching-systems","title":"提示缓存系统","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"提示缓存系统\">提示缓存系统</h1><p>每一次调用大模型，请求的开头几乎都是同一段东西：几千 token 的系统提示、工具定义、检索来的文档、对话历史的前缀。模型却把它们当全新的输入，从头跑一遍前缀（prefill），花掉真金白银的算力与时间。提示缓存（prompt caching）就是把这段「每次都一样」的前缀算一次、存起来，后续请求直接复用——读缓存的价格通常只有原价的一成，首 token 延迟也能砍掉一大截。本 hub 讲清楚这套机制：它复用的到底是什么、按什么语义命中、怎么把命中率做高、又怎么算清楚省了多少钱。</p>\n<p>四个章节是一条递进的主线。<strong>基础</strong>回答「为什么要缓存、缓存的到底是什么」：把提示缓存和它底下的 <a href=\"../kv-cache-optimization/\">KV 缓存</a>分清楚，再讲缓存命中与失效的语义。<strong>机制</strong>深入工程实现：前缀匹配如何逐 token 比对、缓存断点（cache breakpoint）放在哪里、TTL 到期与驱逐如何发生。<strong>优化</strong>是把机制用好的功夫：命中率怎么量化和提升、提示该怎么结构化才对缓存友好、跨会话与跨请求如何让多个调用共享同一份缓存。<strong>实践</strong>落到地面：Anthropic、OpenAI、Google Gemini 三家的缓存模型差异，一个能算清 ROI 的成本节省模型，以及那些会让你「以为缓存了其实没命中」的真实陷阱。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与几个兄弟 hub 的边界要先划清，否则容易越界重复。<a href=\"../kv-cache-optimization/\">KV 缓存优化</a>讲的是 GPU 显存里那份注意力中间态（K、V 张量）如何分页、量化、驱逐——那是缓存的物理底座；本 hub 站在 API 与提示工程的视角，关心的是「请求前缀如何被复用、按 token 计费如何省钱」，把显存细节当黑盒。<a href=\"../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">LLM 服务与推理系统</a>讲的是服务端如何调度、批处理、扩容，prefix sharing 是它的一个能力点；本 hub 不碰调度，只关心用户侧能控制的缓存行为。<a href=\"../ai-cost-latency-optimization/\">AI 成本与延迟优化</a>是更宏观的省钱框架，提示缓存只是它的一个杠杆，那里还有模型路由、语义缓存、提示压缩；本 hub 把「提示缓存」这一个杠杆做深做透。<a href=\"../long-context-llm-techniques/\">长上下文技术</a>关心的是模型能不能在百万 token 里找对信息，本 hub 关心的是这些长前缀如何被缓存复用——两者常常一起用：长系统提示正是提示缓存最大的受益者。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径分两类读者。<strong>应用开发者</strong>（接 API、写 agent、做 RAG）从「基础」整章读起，重点啃<a href=\"foundations/cache-semantics\">缓存语义与失效</a>，然后直接跳到「实践」的<a href=\"practice/provider-caching\">各厂商提示缓存</a>和<a href=\"practice/cost-savings-model\">成本节省模型</a>，最后回头读「优化」章把命中率做上去。<strong>做推理系统或平台的工程师</strong>应顺序通读，尤其是「机制」整章——前缀匹配与缓存断点是你要在系统层兑现的契约。前置知识：理解 token 与上下文窗口（见 <a href=\"../prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/token-and-context-window\">token 与上下文窗口</a>）、知道一次 LLM 调用分 prefill 与 decode 两阶段、对 API 按 token 计费有基本概念即可；不需要先懂 GPU 显存细节，那部分在你需要时再去 KV 缓存 hub 补。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-prompt-caching","title":"为何提示缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/foundations/why-prompt-caching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-vs-kv-cache","title":"提示缓存与 KV 缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/foundations/prompt-vs-kv-cache"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cache-semantics","title":"缓存语义与失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/foundations/cache-semantics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanics","title":"机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prefix-matching","title":"前缀匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics/prefix-matching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-breakpoints","title":"缓存断点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics/cache-breakpoints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cache-ttl-eviction","title":"TTL 与驱逐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics/cache-ttl-eviction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hit-rate-optimization","title":"命中率优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/optimization/hit-rate-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-structuring","title":"面向缓存的提示结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/optimization/prompt-structuring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-session-cache","title":"跨会话缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/optimization/cross-session-cache"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"provider-caching","title":"各厂商提示缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/practice/provider-caching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-savings-model","title":"成本节省模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/practice/cost-savings-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-caching-pitfalls","title":"提示缓存陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/practice/prompt-caching-pitfalls"}]}]}